v0.1.2 Patch (2/7/25)
// Mount Moira, Perel: Added Freeze Crystal Vents: Temporarily reduces accumulation of heat
// Mount Moira, Perel: Added Pocketbreeze Lampposts: Regenerates Energy for the Pocketbreeze Gadget
