v0.1.1 Patch (1/14/25)
// Terrocher Wetlands, Perel: New Region Quest: The Blazing Bridge
// New Region Boss: Entropic Spawn, Vhururuc
// New: Teching mechanic, press shield while colliding with ground during knockback freefall
// New: Air Dodge Gravity(Neutral)
// New: added Jump-Canceling (Mid-Dodge Roll)
// New: EXP Pickup and drop (now drops multiple orbsinstead of one orb)
// New: EXP gain formula
// New: flavor text from NPCs in Terrocher Wetlands
// New: damage calculation & damage indicator HUD
	[list][*] different colors for elemental damage types[/list]
// Adjustment: cardbot attacks now deal extra weapon damage when using weapon attacks only, and base attack when using fists
// Adjustment: New Forward Roll Animation
// Adjustment: New Back Roll Animation
// Adjustment: You can now regain energy mid-air
// Adjustment: Dodge Rolling with no stamina now now longer inflicts slow, the cooldown is increased for each dodge roll
// Fix: bug where dodging caused Cardbot to roll in the wrong direction while locked on a target
// Fix: breakable wall outside in Terrocher Wetlands now has superarmor
// Fix: Changed Totem Level to 1
